  "decision": {
    "chosen": "editorial-paper-collage",
    "rationale": "The task brief asked for a paper-collage direction for this demo; the bake-off tested it on the anchor beat (the loss) against archival, data-led and Swiss treatments. Collage makes the scale the hero (a 150px numeral on a torn sheet) and stays warm for a grave subject. Archival would be more authentic but needs real period imagery this workspace cannot source offline (its photo slot rendered empty); the chart has no time-series to plot and had to label itself illustrative; Swiss is clean but reads as a slide.",
